\par\par \b \uc2 Musk's X Revamps Ahead of \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  Big IPO\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alexander Saeedy and Suzanne Vranica \par \uc2 322 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 March 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B1\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 's X has let go of its chief marketing officer and conducted a round of layoffs of nontechnical staff over the past several weeks as it looks to right-size the social-media company ahead of its parent company \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 's potential $1 trillion-plus IPO, people familiar with the matter said.\par \par \uc2 Angela Zepeda, X's marketing chief since September 2024, was let go last month after Musk announced \uc2 xAI\uc2 's and \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 's merger, people familiar with the matter said. Over the past few weeks, X let go of more than 20 staffers in nontechnical roles including in marketing and other departments seen as duplicative to jobs inside the merged company, the people said.\par \par \uc2 X merged with \uc2 xAI\uc2  last year and \uc2 xAI\uc2  and \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  combined in early February.\par \par \uc2 Most of the remaining staff at X, in addition to concentrating on cost-cutting, have been told to focus on growing X's revenue since \uc2 xAI\uc2  brought on a chief revenue officer, \uc2 Jon Shulkin\uc2 , some of the people said. Shulkin is broadly looking to boost revenue for Musk's social-media company and his artificial-intelligence startup, which both trail competitors in revenue for social-media ads and in enterprise AI sales, those people said.\par \par \uc2 X's U.S. ad revenue is expected to grow 1.5% to $1.27 billion in 2026 from 2025, while global ad sales are anticipated to rise 2.2% to $2.19 billion, according to estimates from Emarketer. In 2021, the last year in which X disclosed annual financials before Musk took the company private, \uc2 Twitter\uc2  said it generated $4.51 billion in advertising revenue.\par \par \uc2 The moves at X echo what's happening elsewhere inside the company since the \uc2 xAI\uc2 -\uc2 SpaceX\uc2  merger. Several co-founders at \uc2 xAI\uc2  have since announced they were leaving the company, and several teams have been restructured.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260327em3r00029\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
